MODIFICATIONS
-------------

This copy has been modified and is not the upstream release. Apache-2.0
section 4(b) requires modified files to say so, and this notice covers the
module.

The changes were made by the Just Player project (https://github.com/moneytoo/Player),
from which Just Player Pro is forked, and were inherited here unchanged. They
cover listing multiple removable storage volumes on Android TV, separating
storage volumes from their contents in the list, theming, and keeping the module
building against current Android and Gradle versions. The commit history of this
repository records each change against this directory.

Just Player Pro has made no further changes to this module.
